      "Language": "por",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Prinzmetal angina is a peculiar kind of angina pectoris, in which Holter monitoring has been particularly useful for diagnosis. In this paper it is reported a 56 years old male patient with coronary artery spasm induced during coronary arteriography in which the Holter electrocardiography was of most importance for decision making."},
